msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a light theme, this is the default and original flavour of JASP."
msgstr "切换到浅色主题，这是 JASP 的默认初始风格。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a dark theme, makes JASP a lot easier on the eyes for those "
"night owls out there."
msgstr "切换到一个黑暗的主题，适用于夜间使用 JASP。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Miscellaneous options"
msgstr "其他选项"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Zoom (%): "
msgstr "界面缩放（%）： "

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Increase or decrease the size of the interface elements (text, buttons, etc)."
msgstr "增加或减少界面元素（文本、按钮等）的大小。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Scroll speed (pix/s): "
msgstr "滚动速度（像素/秒）： "

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Set the speed with which you can scroll in the options, dataviewer and other "
"places."
msgstr "设置您在选项、数据查看器和其他地方滚动的速度。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a \"safer\" mode for graphics aka software rendering.\n"
"It will make your interface slower but if you have some problems (weird "
"glitches, cannot see results or anything even) might fix them.\n"
"Analyses will still be just as fast though."
msgstr ""
"切换到“更安全”的图形模式，也就是软件渲染。\n"
"这将会使界面变慢，但或许您遇到的一些问题（如故障异常，看不到结果甚至任何东"
"西）可能会被修复。\n"
"分析速度依然一样快。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Turns off all animations, this is implied when \"Safe Graphics Mode\" is on."
msgstr "关闭所有动画，这在“安全图形模式”开启时生效。"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Already disabled animations because \"Safe Graphics Mode\" is on"
msgstr "由于 \"安全图形模式 \"处于开启状态，已经禁用了动画"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"If disabled it will not use your operating system's file dialogs but those "
"made by Qt. This might solve some problems on Windows where JASP crashes on "
"pressing \"Browse\"."
msgstr ""
"如果禁用，它不会使用您操作系统的文件对话框，而是使用 Qt 制作的对话框。这可能"
"会解决 Windows 上 JASP 在按下“浏览”时崩溃的一些问题。"

